<view class="page page-motion"><view class="title">Excel导入商品</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{authorized}}"><view class="card space-top"><view class="note">表格必填：商品名称、零售价、数量。价格单位为元，数量是可售件数。有内嵌图片的商品可上架；缺图商品保存为草稿，之后补图即可上架。</view><view class="row space-top"><button class="secondary" bindtap="template" disabled="{{busy}}" hover-start-time="30" hover-stay-time="80">打开空白模板</button><button class="primary" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}" hover-start-time="30" hover-stay-time="80">选择.xlsx表格</button></view><view class="label">表格未填写分组时，使用</view><picker range="{{groups}}" value="{{groupIndex}}" bindchange="group" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="field">{{groups[groupIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="muted">{{fileName}}</view><view class="note">从微信聊天中选择文件。重复导入同一表格不会重复新增，也不会覆盖现有商品库存。</view></view><block wx:if="{{job}}"><view class="card"><view class="section">导入预览</view><view>有效 {{job.count}} 款 · 其中 {{job.drafts}} 款缺图草稿</view><view wx:if="{{job.errors.length}}" class="error">{{job.errors.length}} 行需修改，本次跳过</view><view wx:for="{{errors}}" wx:key="source" class="note">{{item.source}}：{{item.message}}</view><view class="line" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="key"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="row"><text>原价 ¥{{item.priceText}} · 库存 {{item.stock}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.hasImage?'可上架':'草稿'}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.source}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{rows.length < job.rows.length || errors.length < job.errors.length}}" class="secondary space-top" bindtap="more" hover-start-time="30" hover-stay-time="80">查看更多预览</button></view><view wx:if="{{progress}}" class="card">已处理 {{progress}}%</view><button wx:if="{{!done && job.count}}" class="primary" bindtap="commit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" hover-start-time="30" hover-stay-time="80">{{progress?'继续导入':'确认导入 '+job.count+' 款商品'}}</button><view wx:if="{{done}}" class="card"><view class="section">导入完成</view><view class="note">缺图商品请在商品管理中补图，并核对后上架。</view><button class="secondary space-top" bindtap="products" hover-start-time="30" hover-stay-time="80">返回商品管理</button></view></block></block></view>
